Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.39,0:00:03.93,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Their fun summer break has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:06.03,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H9A773D&\fnArial\fs24\bord2\shad0\an8}YEAR 2 CLASS 7\NCULTURE FESTIVAL PLANS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.93,0:00:06.03,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Time to begin planning \Nfor the culture festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.53,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:11.64,Default - Top,teacher,0,0,0,,We wanted to do a play, but we\N didn't get it in the lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.45,0:00:13.28,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs36\c&HA338DA&\3c&H592A7E&\fad(228,142)}WHAAAAAAAAT?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:16.96,Default - Top,teacher,0,0,0,,Instead, year 2 class 7 has been assigned \Nto the food and beverage division.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:18.54,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs36\c&H38D7F9&\3c&H2784D1&\fad(108,64)}OOOOOOOH!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.31,0:00:21.17,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Then, after school...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:25.55,Basic Sign,SIGN; large,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\i1\fs24\c&HC79EF5&\3c&H4A1276&\bord2\pos(242,291)}THE ELITES CALLED\NINTO ACTION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:25.55,Basic Sign,SIGN; in parentheses,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\i1\fs16\c&HC79EF5&\3c&H4A1276&\bord2\pos(409.4,261)}(THE GOING-\NHOME CLUB)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:24.91,Default - Top,Yeti,0,0,0,,the elites are called into action!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:28.42,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh, were you and Tani at the\N library over summer break?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? How'd you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.48,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Gapacho saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:33.30,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Gapacho again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:35.76,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What's this? A library date?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:37.01,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,That's so pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:39.92,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, in the end, it was actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:43.84,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hang on. Never mind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:45.59,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yamada, how did things turn out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.59,0:00:46.00,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:48.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Before summer break, you exchanged \Ncontact info. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.32,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh! I want to know, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:55.20,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Well... we did text a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.84,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,But that's pretty much it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.63,0:00:59.76,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:02.32,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It's completely hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:02.96,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:07.21,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,We did text back and forth, \Nbut I'm just not used to it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.21,0:01:10.15,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I think way too much about how to reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:10.95,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:13.09,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&H82D433&\3c&H5C9826&\bord2\frz25.66\pos(172,168)}BUZZ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.27,0:01:14.72,Flashback,Nishi,0,0,0,,He replied already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:17.97,Basic Sign,SIGN; top bubble,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs20\bord6\fnArial\frz12.07\c&H5C7251&\3c&HBFF5BB&\pos(170.8,136)}I'VE NEVER HAD A PART-TIME JOB BEFORE,\NBUT ONCE I GO TO UNIVERSITY,\NI THINK I MIGHT LIKE TO TRY\NWORKING PART-TIME AT A BOOKSHOP.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:17.97,Basic Sign,SIGN; small,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs20\bord0\fnArial\frz12.07\c&H9C9774&\pos(112.4,151.2)}READ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:17.97,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs20\bord0\fnArial\pos(224,244)\frz14.64\c&H858C8A&}REALLY?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:17.97,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,But Yamada-kun's replies are so short.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.29,0:01:21.48,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Huh? Am I writing much long messages \Nfor no reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.79,0:01:26.48,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I get so scared that \NI might be horribly creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.48,0:01:28.36,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,If you don't like it, \Nyou could ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:28.36,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\pos(104,309)\b0\c&H73FFFD&\3c&H5A295F&\bord2\shad1\4c&HFFFFFF&}YOU CAN'T \NHELP IT, THOUGH
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:30.00,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,No! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:33.36,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I don't think I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:35.99,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,But when he asked if he could call me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:38.41,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs20\bord6\fnArial\b0\move(163,226,163,132,22,272)}WANT TO TALK\NON A CALL?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:40.50,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs20\bord6\fnArial\b0\c&H38603B&\3c&HB3FFA9&\move(323,270,323,170,2066,2275)}SORRY. I'M OUT\NRIGHT NOW
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:38.90,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I've already turned him down twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:40.50,Basic Sign,SIGN; small,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs20\bord0\fnArial\c&H9C9774&\move(233,272,233,170,1774,2025)}READ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:40.50,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs20\bord6\fnArial\b0\pos(157.2,268)}OKAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:40.50,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:43.71,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,In the moment, I lied, \Nand I think he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:47.57,Default - Top,Nishi,0,0,0,,I don't want to push him away, but I've \Nbecome someone who seems like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:49.00,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs20\c&H7C5B26&\pos(258,290)}RESISTANCE\NTO MALES: 0
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.76,0:01:52.51,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Sounds kinda borderline.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:56.83,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But if she texts back, then maybe she's \Njust not comfortable talking or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:01:59.28,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,That seems totally possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.39,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I just don't know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:04.37,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,But I want to know \Nwhat kind of person she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:08.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yamada, I've had this image of you dating \Nlaughing, cheerful girls up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.33,0:02:09.65,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Really? Sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:12.78,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.78,0:02:15.82,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Let's try a little review!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:18.37,Flashback,cheerful girl,0,0,0,,Yamada, you're seriously hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:26.17,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,The man who's easily attracted \Nto an unlikely smile, Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:27.92,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,One day...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:32.38,Flashback,cheerful girl,0,0,0,,You've probably already realized this, \Nbut... Yamada, I'm in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:34.18,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord2\c&HC9FFFB&\3c&H2B49AC&\move(-20,191,88,191,1,314)}OF COURSE\NHE HAD\NNO IDEA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:33.31,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:38.68,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\pos(562,70)\fs26\c&HC17049&\bord2\fad(1,500)}CURIOUS\NABOUT
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:38.68,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\pos(560,349)\fs26\c&HC17049&\bord2\fad(1,500)}(LIKES...?)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:35.80,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fs26\c&HC26D42&\3c&HFAFFE2&\fad(0,500)\move(110,239,351,213,766,1308)\bord4}FEW\NCHANCES\NTO\NINTERACT
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:38.64,Basic Sign,SIGN; right side of left bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs26\c&H0667E0&\bord2\move(26,409,253,125,0,350)\fad(1,500)}LIKES\NJUST\NFINE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.43,0:02:38.68,Basic Sign,SIGN; left side of left bubble,0,0,0,,{\fs26\c&H0667E0&\bord4\3c&HB2FFFE&\move(16,188,55,162,0,350)\fad(1,500)}GET\NALONG\NWELL\NTOGETHER
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.17,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,How about we date, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:46.19,Flashback,cheerful girl,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:47.62,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.15,0:02:53.19,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(81,321)\fs24\c&H8F3715&\3c&HD3FCFA&}HAS\NEXPERIENCE\NDATING
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.15,0:02:53.19,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(564,321)\fs24\c&H8F3715&\3c&HD3FCFA&}ONE-SIDED\NLOVE RETURN\NRATE: {\3c&H8F3715&\bord2\c&HF6DFA8&}0%
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:53.19,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord2\fs24\c&H9CE8FB&\3c&H988CDC&\move(633,85,-30,85)}BUT IN THEIR OWN WAY, THOSE ARE GOOD MEMORIES...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:55.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You know, despite Yamada being like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.55,0:02:58.11,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,he stayed with his last girlfriend \Nfor a pretty long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.11,0:02:59.64,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "like this"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.64,0:03:01.58,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I mean, now we're just good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.63,0:03:06.26,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Sounds amazing. \NThat's the youth I wish I'd had.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:09.21,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Azu, you still have time for that youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:10.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But I totally get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:14.24,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous of people \Nwho have really dated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:16.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,They'll always have that \Nexperience to draw on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:17.66,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Suzuki, you're dating now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:21.93,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is basically my first time, \Nso I'm feeling my way along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:22.47,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:25.98,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, don't pretend like you and \NRicchan were never a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:27.20,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Ricchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:49.21,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,115)\fnArial}YOU AND I ARE POLAR OPPOSITES
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.95,0:05:06.51,Default - Top,Taira,0,0,0,,If we just pick out stuff that's \Ngreen and leafy, we should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:07.20,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\bord6\c&H5B742A&\3c&HCDFEE1&\pos(323,290)}OUT SHOPPING BECAUSE THEY\NLOST AT ROCK-PAPER-SCISSORS
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.03,0:05:10.83,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Uniforms from our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:14.15,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,We want button badge covers \Nand plushie stands, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.15,0:05:15.11,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Plushie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:20.34,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Hey, Hon-chan, over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:21.93,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It's Tani-kun, the guy\NI mentioned before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.93,0:05:22.94,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:26.30,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Oh, the bespectacled light novel \Nprotagonist with a gyaru girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:27.35,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:36.36,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Hey, Tani.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:38.65,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,We're checking out and \Ngetting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:44.11,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord8\fnArial\fs26\pos(312.8,290)}TRAUMA RESPONSE TO GIRLS WHISPERING
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:42.57,Italics - Top,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,They were clearly looking \Nat us and saying something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:43.49,Italics - Top,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:47.62,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord8\fnArial\fs20\pos(314.4,290)\c&H8A4FDE&\3c&HDFFFFD&}GIRLS WHO COULDN'T CARE LESS
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:47.23,Default - Top,Honda,0,0,0,,Hundred yen shops \Nseriously have everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.62,0:05:49.57,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What's that about? Who's Ricchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.57,0:05:53.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,U-Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.93,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, that's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:56.64,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You're saying he doesn't count, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.64,0:05:59.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:03.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I feel so bad about what I did. \NI was just so inexperienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:05.26,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:09.77,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\c&HA6FFFE&\3c&H5602A1&\fnArial\fs24\an6}SURPRISE!!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.61,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,We finished the giant menu boards!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:09.77,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,203.6)\fnImpact\c&H800075&\bord2}BOOM
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.61,0:06:09.77,Default,Suzuki; Yamada,0,0,0,,Wow! Those are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:11.94,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,They're just like \Nthe ones from that shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.94,0:06:12.77,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:14.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, Sato, did you do the lettering?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:15.36,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,The pictures, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:16.91,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Whoa! You're basically a pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:19.46,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Hey, Yamada. What kind of \Nperson is this Ricchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:18.40,Default - Top,Watanabe; adlib,0,0,0,,She totally is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:20.04,Default - Top,Satou; adlib,0,0,0,,If we had a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.46,0:06:20.08,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:22.44,Default - Top,Watanabe; adlib,0,0,0,,She's a total genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:22.03,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,A super great guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:22.03,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H391066&\bord1\an4}NONSPECIFIC!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:23.60,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:23.50,Default - Top,Watanabe; adlib,0,0,0,,Right? Right? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:26.22,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh, he said he'll be \Nat the culture festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:27.02,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,so you can meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:27.72,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:32.54,Default - Top,couple; girl; adlib,0,0,0,,So, what should we do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:34.24,Default - Top,couple; boy; adlib,0,0,0,,Let's go eat that thing \Nwe saw last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:35.78,Default - Top,couple; girl,0,0,0,,Good idea! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:38.76,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Hey, Tani. \NIs Suzuki your first girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:39.73,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:41.04,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.42,0:06:44.05,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Do you ever think stuff like, \Nyou're not sure how dating works?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:46.94,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Or you don't have enough experience?\NDo you have doubts like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:51.21,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I mean, he doesn't seem like the \Ntype to worry about that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:54.19,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I used to look down on Tani,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.19,0:06:58.18,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,but now I'm trying to use him \Nas a reference. That's so pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:06:59.19,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I think those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:00.07,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:02.69,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm constantly doubting myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.74,0:07:06.15,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:08.95,Basic Sign,SIGN; t shirts,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\pos(114.4,298)}MEAT
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:08.95,Basic Sign,SIGN; t shirts,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\frz29.14\pos(596.8,289.2)}MEAT
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:11.29,Default,Suzuki; Yamada; Watanabe,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:14.96,Basic Sign,SIGN; left box,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\pos(145.2,197)}CULTURE FESTIVAL, DAY 1\N{\fs16}(STUDENTS AND STAFF ONLY)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:14.96,Basic Sign,SIGN; banner,0,0,0,,{\c&H4D5DE4&\3c&H73F3F5&\pos(388.8,169.2)\frz354.7}C{\c&HF7AB69&}U{\c&H4CFC41&}L{\c&H4D5DE4&}T{\c&H4CFC41&}U{\c&HF7AB69&}R{\c&H4CFC41&}E {\c&H4D5DE4&}F{\c&HF7AB69&}E{\c&H4CFC41&}S{\c&H4D5DE4&}T{\c&HF7AB69&}I{\c&H4CFC41&}V{\c&H4D5DE4&}A{\c&HF7AB69&}L
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:13.97,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Start the culture festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:17.70,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,All right! Let's enjoy day one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.71,Default,class,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:27.22,Basic Sign,SIGN; ribbon,0,0,0,,{\fs24\pos(331.2,230.8)\frz59.23}YOU WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.22,0:07:31.72,Basic Sign,SIGN; banner,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\c&H584FD3&\fs20\pos(177.6,70.8)}SOLD OUT! THANK YOU!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:35.73,Basic Sign,SIGN; box; top line,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\pos(508.4,158.6)}CULTURE FESTIVAL, DAY 2\N{\fs16}(VISITORS ALLOWED)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:34.89,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,On day two, the festival\Nis open to the public!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:41.36,Basic Sign,SIGN; large; upper left,0,0,0,,{\c&H48D2E7&\fnImpact\bord1\pos(133.6,31.6)}DOKKIRI BINKEY
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:38.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Today, Tani-kun and I will be \Nwalking around together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:39.79,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You're so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:40.57,Default,Sato,0,0,0,,Bye. Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:41.36,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:44.08,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Suzuki, your shirt is already all black.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:48.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, you should write something, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.45,0:07:49.30,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:51.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,A message to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:58.40,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,"To Suzuki-san..."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:00.45,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Stop it. Don't read it aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:02.46,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Don't read it silently either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:05.01,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey. You're still calling her \N"Suzuki-san"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:08.50,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Just "Suzuki" would be better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:09.31,Default,Satou; Taira,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:11.59,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Don't just agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:12.22,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\fs24\pos(574,318)\c&HE1F6BC&\3c&H7F4D13&\bord2\fad(1,354)}BUT\NNORMALLY\NTHAT'S...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.59,0:08:14.26,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(401,1)\fs48\frz11.3\pos(344,94)\c&HEFF3F5&\3c&HF2ACEE&\bord2\shad2\4c&HDC967E&}COZY CAFE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:15.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Where should we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:16.02,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs24\c&H5100D3&\3c&HB9D1F5&\pos(436.8,98)}JAPANESE{\c&H1B326A&\bord2\3c&HE3F7FD&}-STYLE\NFOOD STALL
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:17.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, how did you \Nlook around last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:20.99,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,The class project was a play, \Nso I didn't look around much that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:25.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? Then I'll put the perfect plan \Ntogether and show you around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:26.89,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:31.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,First, we'll prioritize the things \Nthat have set times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:35.54,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H78CEEB&\3c&H5CA3D2&\bord2\shad3\4c&HA6FBF2&\pos(446.4,86.8)}RE{\4c&HADFDE7&}ST {\4c&HF2E2EF&}AR{\4c&HF9FAC9&}EA
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:35.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,{\an3}When we get tired, we'll get tea and \Nbaked sweets at the PTA's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:37.04,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H756ED3&\frz353\move(339,76,384,74)}GLOBAL WARMING
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:38.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And we can't forget class \Nand club exhibitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:40.54,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(466.4,150.8)\frz6.811}PHOTOGRAPHY\NCLUB\NEXHIBITION
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:46.30,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I have nothing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:50.55,Basic Sign,SIGN; large,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\bord1\c&HB9F098&\3c&HA59D5C&\pos(116,173.2)}WELCOME TO\N{\c&HA3D2CE&}OUR EXHIBITION{\c&H907ED3&}!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:50.55,Basic Sign,SIGN; small,0,0,0,,{\fs12\pos(170,70.8)\3c&HA59D5C&\c&HE9EAC9&}TAKE YOUR TIME\NLOOKING AROUND
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:50.55,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,People keep peeking in and then leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:53.70,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Could it be that I'm giving off \Na negative aura?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:55.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? There's an exhibition here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:08:59.69,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:01.53,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,These two are...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:09.53,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,It's actually more awkward when \N I know the person a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:11.89,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:14.32,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:17.32,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,She must be saying, "You two work\N in the library together, right?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:21.33,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! We're not close enough for \Nthat to work as a conversation hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:25.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Is it all right for us \Nto talk while we look around?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:28.09,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh... That's completely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:30.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:32.58,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I wonder if they really are dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:34.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,When does the photography club \Ndo their activities?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:36.72,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,You're going to talk to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:42.54,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, um, we don't get together as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:44.59,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It's more like we all work individually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.59,0:09:46.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:50.91,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, I like this photo! \NThe colors are beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:52.70,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:54.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really? That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:57.34,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:10:00.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, but I really like this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:02.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Did you use special techniques or cameras?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:05.00,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,No, nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:07.25,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It's a camera meant for beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:08.63,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.63,0:10:10.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:11.83,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:14.75,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, which one do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.75,0:10:15.64,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:17.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,A cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:19.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I mean, it's a good photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:22.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But, Tani-kun, that's just because \Nyou like cats, right? Honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.55,0:10:23.67,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:27.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Thanks for teaching us so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.59,0:10:31.90,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:34.91,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I feel like I spoke pretty well!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:39.16,Italics - Top,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I kept our conversational rally going, \Nand there weren't any long silences!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.95,0:10:39.16,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.4,281.2)\c&H5D00E8&\3c&HD3FFFB&\fad(976,1)}SELF-CONFIDENCE{\fs16} (A TINY BIT) {\fs36}UP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.98,0:10:42.89,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,If only I could do that every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:46.67,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Being clear without getting too nervous...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:48.67,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Where are you right now? I'll head to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:51.30,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,More cheerful and pleasant...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:52.55,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What can you see right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.05,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Energetic and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:57.05,Default,Yamda,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:01.72,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh! I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:05.72,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:12.59,Italics,Rihito,0,0,0,,Huh? Hello? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:18.95,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Hey, Taira! Why don't you \Ngo out front for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:22.12,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,It's fine. And I don't know \Nwho might show up today either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:25.16,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,You made all that effort to change. \NYou're gonna regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:26.05,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,No one asked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:27.71,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:30.77,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Go on! The world outside is \Nmore fun than you might expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:31.96,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:33.48,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:36.06,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Is Yamada in your class?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:37.46,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Oh. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:39.70,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Huh? He was here just a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:41.54,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:43.97,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,After hanging up like that, \NI wonder where he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.47,0:11:46.48,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,I guess it doesn't matter. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:48.30,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,I'll look for him myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:50.97,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,He's so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:51.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(231,1)\fnArial\fs20\pos(77.6,264.4)\bord1\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HCC647A&}HE READS AS\N"POPULAR WITH\NTHE LADIES"...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:54.67,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Wait. Was that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:57.61,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, that was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.89,0:12:00.87,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Isn't it great that they gave us \Nprizes at Struck Out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.87,0:12:02.95,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's dangerous if you don't look \Nwhere you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.95,0:12:03.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:08.78,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:10.20,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:10.63,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Miyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:15.26,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,I knew it was you, Miyu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:16.73,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:19.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Rihito.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:23.17,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh? Oka?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.17,0:12:25.64,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Satou! It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:26.90,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,You came.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:27.50,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:28.46,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Someone you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:29.50,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Yeah, from middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:31.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Um, Tani-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:34.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is my classmate from \Nmiddle school, Oka-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:36.34,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Oka, did you come alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.34,0:12:38.51,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Nah. I'm here with friends \Nfrom high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:40.53,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,I'm just operating solo \Nfor a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:44.41,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,I heard that Yamada, Sato, \Nand Miyu were all in the same class,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:46.29,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,so I thought I might be able to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:55.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's really been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:56.21,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.46,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Probably since we graduated, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:12:59.56,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Have you been well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:01.54,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,I'm doing all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:06.28,Italics,Suzuki; Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,This is so awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:11.62,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It's been so long that all I can do is \Nsmile and talk about safe topics.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:14.23,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Hey, Yamada! Please get here soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.23,0:13:16.76,Italics,Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,I mean, it's been so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:20.08,Italics,Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be fine if \NI acted like nothing happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:21.74,Italics,Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,but it's not working at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.74,0:13:24.28,Flashback - Top,past Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,Like I said, nothing's better \Nthan rhythm stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:25.32,Italics,Suzuki; Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,If only things hadn't gotten \Nweird back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:26.74,Flashback - Top,past Rihito; background,0,0,0,,And that's why your thing \Nis so weird, Miyu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:33.00,Basic Sign,SIGN; banner,0,0,0,,{\frz347.3\pos(496.8,151.6)\fad(1,150)}MIDDLE SCHOOL\NYEAR 3
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:29.96,Flashback,past Suzuki,0,0,0,,No human can ever escape the beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:31.68,Flashback,past Rihito,0,0,0,,What authority said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:33.92,Flashback,friend 1,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:35.71,Flashback,friend 1,0,0,0,,Are the two of you dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.71,0:13:36.98,Flashback,friend 1,0,0,0,,You're always together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:37.97,Flashback,friend 2,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:40.00,Flashback Italics,past Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,Ugh, what a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:41.26,Flashback,past Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:43.17,Flashback,friend 2,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you just date already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.17,0:13:45.28,Flashback,friends,0,0,0,,Right? They look good together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.85,0:13:49.89,Flashback - Top,friends; background,0,0,0,,Go on, Rihito! Right? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.87,0:13:49.89,Flashback Italics,past Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,This is one of those things where the\Nmore we deny it, the weirder it'll get.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:54.08,Flashback Italics,past Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,If I go with the flow, and Miyu \Ncompletely shuts it down, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:57.33,Flashback,past Rihito,0,0,0,,Miyu, do you want to go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:58.07,Flashback,past Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:00.02,Flashback,past Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.47,0:14:03.67,Flashback,past Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, um, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:08.10,Flashback - Top,friends,0,0,0,,Wow! Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.56,0:14:06.41,Flashback Italics,past Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:10.66,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz14.75\pos(520,106)\fad(230,1)\fs24\c&H6D5445&\bord2}CAN'T SAY\NIT WAS A JOKE IN\NTHIS ATMOSPHERE...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:10.28,Flashback Italics,past Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,Wait, wait! You can't seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:12.57,Flashback Italics,past Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,I guess it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:18.67,Flashback Italics,past Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Both of us started out with an \N"I'm not vehemently opposed" mindset.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:23.03,Flashback Italics,past Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,This is awkward. \NWhat did we used to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.43,0:14:25.98,Flashback Italics,past Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It used to be that all we'd do was laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.98,0:14:29.52,Flashback Italics,past Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Now that we're dating, \Nit isn't fun at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:33.81,Flashback,past Rihito,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.55,0:14:37.00,Flashback,past Rihito,0,0,0,,Do you want to try doing something \Nthat's more couple-ish?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:41.94,Flashback Italics,past Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'm not feeling "I don't hate him" \Nso much as I am "actually, I like him."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:45.69,Flashback Italics,past Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Oh. This isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:51.44,Flashback Italics,past Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I can't explain it well, \Nbut there's no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:52.58,Flashback Italics,past Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Somehow, this isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:56.83,Flashback,past Rihito,0,0,0,,Yeah. I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.11,0:14:59.04,Flashback,past Rihito,0,0,0,,This isn't us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.59,Flashback,past Rihito,0,0,0,,That's not our groove together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.84,0:15:03.12,Flashback,past Rihito,0,0,0,,This never happened. \NLet's go back to how we were!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:04.47,Flashback,past Rihito,0,0,0,,Friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:06.47,Flashback Italics,past Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I made him say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:08.83,Flashback Italics,past Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I forced him have to be considerate of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:09.90,Flashback,past Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.85,0:15:13.22,Italics,Suzuki; Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:16.48,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\b0\fs28\frz12.66\pos(67.2,248.4)\bord2\c&HD6FFC6&\3c&H63491E&}WENT\NWITH\NTHE\NFLOW
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:16.48,Italics,Rihito; internal,0,0,0,,Why is it that the more you feel you're \Nat fault for something in your memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:19.98,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,...the more you keep getting stuck \Non the feelings you don't like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:19.98,Basic Sign,SIGN; smaller,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\b0\bord2\c&HDA9CE3&\3c&H6B2F52&\pos(430,120)}NONCOMMITTAL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:19.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs12\pos(607.2,70)\fnImpact\b0\bord1\c&HDA9CE3&\3c&H6B2F52&\}HALF-\NHEARTED\NMOVES
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:22.60,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.12,0:15:28.23,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,If I apologized... That would be \Ntoo self-centered of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.23,0:15:30.38,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I just want to make myself feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.48,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.87,0:15:33.66,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,When our middle school\N group gets together,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:35.75,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,you make sure not to \Ncome if I'm there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.75,0:15:36.57,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.57,0:15:39.63,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,That's gotta be a pain, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:41.92,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. Any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:42.75,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:48.53,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Let's hang out like normal \Nagain sometime. We're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:49.93,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Here. We're good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:51.05,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:53.26,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Y-Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:56.11,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,See you later. I'm gonna look for Dayama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:15:59.72,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Rihito!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:02.27,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I made it so you had to be \Nconsiderate of me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:05.18,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What? You guys hadn't \Nworked things out yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.18,0:16:09.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's sort of... I think \Nwe finally just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:15.30,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It's like all the uneasiness I felt \Nin the past disappeared all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.66,0:16:18.43,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey. Maybe you guys from the same \Nmiddle school are cool with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:20.90,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,but the feeling of alienation \Nover here is intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.90,0:16:22.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:23.43,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Right, Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:29.75,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:35.02,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Well, I'll leave the rest \Nto you two youngsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:36.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:43.94,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Which is why there was a second \Nwhere we thought "let's try dating,"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:46.47,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but we ended up thinking \N"no, this is wrong" pretty quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.23,0:16:50.22,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Trying to cover it up\N would have felt more wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.22,0:16:52.82,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,so I told him everything, but... \Ndid I dig my own grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:57.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We made a weird mistake, but he was \Nmy friend then and he's my friend now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.27,0:16:59.23,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.59,0:17:02.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You understand what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.51,0:17:03.39,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:08.59,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I wonder if Tani-kun \Ndoesn't like women with pasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:12.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, I think of you \Nas my first boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:19.40,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sorry you had to make me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:23.65,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I think the problem here lies with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.65,0:17:25.61,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'll go sort out my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:30.24,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.61,0:17:33.32,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Ricchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.39,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.39,0:17:36.24,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:39.47,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,But thanks to you, I think Miyu \Nand I may have made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.47,0:17:41.50,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh? You two weren't getting along?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:44.45,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,No, you know what I mean, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.45,0:17:46.40,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I mean, I do know, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:46.88,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(129.6,275.6)\c&HB4FDF8&\3c&H724C58&\fs28}DOES\NNOT\NKNOW
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:50.64,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Well, we're just gonna erase \Na bunch of stuff, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:51.46,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:56.75,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,I remember my mistakes perfectly well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:18:00.32,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Actually, instead of romance-type stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:03.25,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,I think my desire not to be hated \Nby my friends is far stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:04.02,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.02,0:18:06.26,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,There's no one who'd hate you, Ricchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:08.78,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(503.2,330.8)\fad(191,1)\fs22\c&H6FF9FB&\3c&H62005B&}THIS IS WHY I LOVE\NMY MIDDLE SCHOOL FAM...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.26,0:18:08.19,Default,Rihito,0,0,0,,Yama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:11.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But what did he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:14.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,"The problem lies with me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:15.90,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,It's probably just jealousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.41,0:18:15.16,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\i1\fs24\pos(573.6,182.8)\c&H95F5F7&\3c&H615D13&\4c&H615D13&\shad1\fad(1,150)}RIBBIT
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:18.75,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But there's really nothing \Nbetween me and Rihito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.75,0:18:20.63,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Well, Ricchan is a hottie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:24.79,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Even if he is handsome and we're \Ngood friends and he's a boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:29.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,for me, that doesn't add up to romance. \NThat's what I learned back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.55,0:18:38.05,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,There isn't nothing. \NThere's self-reflection and regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.71,0:18:42.10,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Still... first boyfriend \Nand first girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:44.39,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,It's so sweet and pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:46.98,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,My own history is already far too sullied.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:48.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, that has nothing to do with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:53.11,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,An innocent past, your firsts...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:56.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The fact that having nothing in your past \Nis considered "pure" is weird, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:58.95,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What's going on? \NIt's like a switch flipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.27,0:19:02.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Even if I were a woman who'd slept \Nwith a hundred people in my past!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:03.58,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Slept with?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:08.42,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If I want to face the person in front of \Nme with sincerity now and in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:10.34,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,then that's pure, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:13.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.72,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\pos(61.6,343.6)\c&H74F0F3&\3c&H7C7E61&\bord1}I AM\NYOUR\N"NOW"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:14.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go to Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.97,0:19:15.72,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:18.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:24.03,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.82,0:19:27.54,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,For some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.54,0:19:29.40,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,I want to be in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:34.86,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:41.99,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(557.6,42)\c&HFCE37C&\bord1\3c&HAA4833&\fad(231,1)}DROOP
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:40.48,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh. It's just you, Taira.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.48,0:19:41.27,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:48.50,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord1\c&H2A324F&\3c&H3B82DF&\frz24.07\pos(174.4,351.6)\fs24}LET'S HAVE\NTHE BEST, \NFUNNEST DAY!\N-S
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:56.18,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I knew from the start that she'd \Nhave friends I didn't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.61,0:20:00.05,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,There's no point in feeling unsettled \Nby things that are already past.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.05,0:20:01.01,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.01,0:20:02.80,Flashback,Rihito,0,0,0,,Let's hang out like normal again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:09.27,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos(432.8,110.8)\frz340.1\bord1\shad1\c&H740A1C&\4c&HFECB3E&}THEN WHY\NDOES HE\NSTILL CALL\NHER BY HER\NFIRST NAME?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:09.27,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord1\shad1\c&H740A1C&\4c&HFECB3E&\frz21.73\pos(186.4,90.8)}IF THERE'S A\NGET-TOGETHER,\NWILL SHE SEE\NHIM THERE?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:09.27,Basic Sign,SIGN; top; bottom left; bottom right,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H940FAB&\3c&HB874A3&\bord2\blur2\frz341.5\pos(38.4,350)}STRESS
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:09.27,Default,SIGN; top; bottom left; bottom right,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H940FAB&\3c&HB874A3&\bord2\blur2\frz23.76\pos(605.6,342)}STRESS
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:09.27,Default,SIGN; top; bottom left; bottom right,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H940FAB&\3c&HB874A3&\bord2\blur2\pos(278.4,32.8)\frz19.44}STRESS
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.92,0:20:07.73,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,little things about the present \Nand the future worry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.71,0:20:11.44,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Why is it that with each passing day,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:14.28,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,instead of growing bolder, \NI grow greedier?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:16.97,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Why is my heart getting smaller?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.57,0:20:20.49,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.41,0:20:23.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.11,0:20:27.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:32.75,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, the way that you don't lie and \Nsay exactly what you mean... I love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:35.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:38.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,you'll say, "I'm totally fine,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.78,0:20:41.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but actually your thoughts \Nare spinning around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:44.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:48.17,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Even if you can't be totally clear, \Nor if you're still thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.17,0:20:52.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If you feel anxious and unsettled \Nfor some reason, just tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.98,0:20:57.51,Italics - Top,Gomapon,0,0,0,,Well, we're about to start \Nthe awards ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.51,0:21:00.72,Italics - Top,Gomapon,0,0,0,,so if all students could assemble \Nin the gym please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:04.21,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Should we just stay here like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:13.05,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,There's no point in comparing myself \Nto others, but I got anxious anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.05,0:21:16.42,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,And I hated that I felt that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:19.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's what you hated? Not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:19.94,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.94,0:21:22.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for making you feel like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.38,0:21:23.05,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:24.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Is there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:28.10,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, you seem like \Nyou'd like someone like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:29.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:31.69,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\bord2\pos(136,238)\frz10.76\c&HFBDB98&\3c&H787120&}SUDAKEN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.12,0:21:30.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You say that, Tani-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.78,0:21:34.27,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but aren't there a lot of people who \Nwould suit you better than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:34.31,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\pos(576,230.8)\c&H42004C&\3c&HE6BBD6&}DEMURE\NTYPES{\c&HD1CCFA&\3c&H490553&} ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:35.26,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No, there aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.26,0:21:36.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yes, there are!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:37.39,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.39,0:21:39.28,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I don't know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:45.20,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What are we talking about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.71,0:21:47.58,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Miyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.35,0:21:50.79,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Is that what everyone called you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:54.46,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? Um, no, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.73,0:21:58.43,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,With Rihito, it was more like \Nhe was being contrarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.43,0:21:59.46,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Rihito.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:02.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:05.31,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If there's something you'd like \Nto say, then please say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.31,0:22:07.00,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.91,0:22:09.65,Italics - Top,Gomapon,0,0,0,,Year 2 Class 7...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:10.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,In that case, Yuusu—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.65,0:22:15.44,Italics - Top,Gomapon,0,0,0,,Tani Yuusuke, Suzuki Miyu, \Nplease report to the gym!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.44,0:22:16.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, they noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.79,0:22:22.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, let's go! Yuusuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:27.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Everyone's already gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.14,0:22:31.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We're definitely gonna get teased \Nabout getting summoned together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:33.28,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right, Yuusuke-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:37.00,Basic Sign,SIGN; center,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs12\pos(253.2,182.4)\c&H28304D&\3c&H367CE2&}TO SUZUKI-SAN,\NI LOOK FORWARD TO\NOUR CONTINUED RELATIONSHIP
