Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:37.00,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs12\c&H28304D&\3c&H367CE2&\frz344.8\pos(169.2,204)}-REINA
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:37.00,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs12\c&H28304D&\3c&H367CE2&\frz344.8\pos(146.8,229.6)}ME TOO
