Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:37.00,Basic Sign,SIGN; right shoulder,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs12\c&H28304D&\3c&H367CE2&\frz339.4\pos(486,154.4)}YOUR VOICE\NIS TOO LOUD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:37.00,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs12\c&H28304D&\3c&H367CE2&\frz20.47\pos(486.8,209.6)}YOU TALK\NTOO MUCH
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.99,0:22:36.20,Default - Top,Tani,0,0,0,,You don't have to \Nforce yourself to call me that.
